{"ticker":{"symbol":"230240.KQ","name":"에치에프알","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":9950.0,"change_pct":-0.014851485148514865,"market_cap":129794785280.0,"pe":6.606906,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":8650.0,"week52_high":39700.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.hfrnet.com","business_summary":"HFR, Inc. provides digital infrastructure solutions for telco/enterprise markets in the field of wired and wireless access in South Korea. The company offers mobile access solutions, such as flexi-haul WDM xHaul, semi-passive WDM xHaul, packet xHaul, distributed antenna systems, and carrier ethernet switches. It also provides broadband access solutions, including FTTH, FTTB+LAN, and FTTB+G solutions; and private 5G solutions comprising BSS/OSS, vCore, vRAN, and vertical applications for digital transformation in enterprises and industries. In addition, the company offers 5G-PON; OLT, PON OLT, OLT, PON OLT, ONU/MDU, PON ONU, CPE, Home CPE, Wi-Fi AP, and PoE and TNS Switch; and 5G SA Network products. HFR, Inc. was founded in 2000 and is based in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"HFR, Inc.는 한국의 유무선 액세스 분야에서 통신업체/기업 시장을 위한 디지털 인프라 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 플렉시홀 WDM xHaul, 세미패시브 WDM xHaul, 패킷 xHaul, 분산 안테나 시스템, 캐리어 이더넷 스위치와 같은 모바일 액세스 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 FTTH, FTTB+LAN 및 FTTB+G 솔루션을 포함한 광대역 액세스 솔루션도 제공합니다. 기업 및 산업의 디지털 혁신을 위한 BSS/OSS, vCore, vRAN 및 수직 애플리케이션으로 구성된 프라이빗 5G 솔루션입니다. 또한 회사는 5G-PON을 제공합니다. OLT, PON OLT, OLT, PON OLT, ONU/MDU, PON ONU, CPE, 홈 CPE, Wi-Fi AP, PoE 및 TNS 스위치; 및 5G SA 네트워크 제품. HFR, Inc.는 2000년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":110400000000.0,"rev_lo":110400000000.0,"rev_hi":110400000000.0,"rev_g":null,"n":1,"eps":-4969.0,"eps_lo":-4969.0,"eps_hi":-4969.0,"eps_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":174400000000.0,"rev_lo":174400000000.0,"rev_hi":174400000000.0,"rev_g":0.5797,"n":